{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-hadron","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:hadron","kind":"definition","title":"Hadron (stable knot composite)","examples":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-hadron-operations","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-knot-factorization","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-knot-particle-dictionary"],"tags":["hadron","knot","composite","stable","crossing-energy"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Hadron","text":"hadron.md","leanSource":"hadron.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:hadron\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K_1, \\ldots, K_n</code> be prime knot types in the representation category <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code>. Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}</code> be a link encoding their internal entanglement. A <strong>hadron</strong> is a composite</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathfrak{H}_p = [K_1, \\ldots, K_n]_p \\oplus \\mathcal{L}</code></pre>\n<p>satisfying the <strong>stability condition</strong>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathfrak{E}_{\\mathrm{cross}}(\\mathfrak{H}_p) &#x3C; 0.</code></pre>\n<p>The subscript <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code> specifies the localization point. The operator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\oplus</code> denotes linking.</p>\n<p><strong>Archimedean specialisation.</strong> What follows sits on the archimedean side of the substrate wall. Categorical identities hold over an abstract coefficient ring; only their archimedean realisation is specialised here.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/hadron.md","heading":"Definition","number":"9.3.1","page":"b/def-hadron","qa":{"counts":{"pass":80,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Hadron","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/hadron.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
